<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Welcome to Cansoria Studio</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #332d28; background: #f7f4ef; margin: 0; padding: 24px;">
  <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 28px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #eee6dc;">
    <h1 style="color: #2d2926;">Welcome to Cansoria Studio</h1>
    <p>Hi {{first_name}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for creating an account with Cansoria. Your studio account helps you track orders, caseback engravings, shipping updates, and private offers.</p>
    <p>Every Cansoria watch is assembled and regulated in-house, with careful attention to case size, strap, dial, and the details that make it yours.</p>
    {{#if discountCode}}
      <div style="margin: 24px 0; padding: 20px; background: #f7f2ec; border: 1px solid #eadfd3; text-align: center;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 8px;">Your studio welcome code:</p>
        <strong style="font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 2px;">{{discountCode}}</strong>
        {{#if validUntil}}<p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 13px;">Valid until {{validUntil}}</p>{{/if}}
      </div>
    {{/if}}
    <p>If you have questions about sizing, straps, engraving, or timelines, feel free to reply to this email.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p>The Cansoria Studio Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
